        chips: ["By shifting the focus", "away from rigid rules", "you are more likely to", "develop sustainable", "healthy eating habits"],
        hint: "By -ing + be more likely to (v할 가능성이 높다)"
      },
      {
        passageNo: "37번",
        korean: "좋은 에세이를 쓰는 것은 조사로 서둘러 들어가는 것이 아니라 질문을 주의 깊게 읽는 것에서 시작된다.",
        targetSentence: "writing a good essay starts with reading the question carefully not rushing into research",
        chips: ["writing a good essay", "starts with", "reading the question carefully", "not rushing into research"],
        hint: "동명사 주어 + starts with ~ing + not -ing 대조"
      }
    ],
    summaryBlanks: [
      {
        passageNo: "36번",
        text: "Rather than strict restrictions, achieving healthy eating requires balance, moderation, and long-term [ Blank A ].",
        optionsA: ["sustainability", "punishment", "isolation"],
        correctA: "sustainability"
      },
      {
        passageNo: "37번",
        text: "Successful essay writing begins with carefully analyzing the prompt before searching for [ Blank A ] information.",
        optionsA: ["relevant", "random", "unrelated"],
        correctA: "relevant"
      }
    ],
    originalPassages: [
      {
        no: "36번",
        text: "Many people try to improve their diets by eliminating certain foods entirely, but this approach can backfire. Restrictive diets often lead to feelings of deprivation... Instead of labeling foods as 'good' or 'bad,' it's healthier to think in terms of balance, moderation, and long-term sustainability..."
      },
      {
        no: "37번",
        text: "When students get an essay question, many students start looking for information right away without understanding the question first. This tendency can cause them to feel confused... In short, writing a good essay starts with reading the question carefully - not rushing into research."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 6,
    title: "6회차 (38번, 39번)",
    passagesInfo: "38번: 브론토사우루스의 생태 | 39번: 반려견 복제 논란",
    vocabularies: [
      { id: 'v1', word: 'fierce', meaning: '사나운, 거친', passage: '38번' },
      { id: 'v2', word: 'inherently', meaning: '선천적으로, 본질적으로', passage: '39번' },
      { id: 'v3', word: 'conception', meaning: '수정, 임신, 개념', passage: '39번' },
      { id: 'v4', word: 'contentedly', meaning: '만족스럽게', passage: '38번' },
      { id: 'v5', word: 'opponents', meaning: '반대자들', passage: '39번' },
      { id: 'v6', word: 'morality', meaning: '도덕성', passage: '39번' }
    ],
    unscrambles: [
      {
        passageNo: "38번",
        korean: "그것은 너무 크고 무거워서 육지에서는 금방 지쳤고 엄청난 무게를 지탱하는 데 도움이 되도록 물이 필요했다.",
        targetSentence: "It was so big and heavy that it got tired quickly on land and needed the water to help support its great weight",
        chips: ["It was so big and heavy", "that it got tired quickly on land", "and needed the water", "to help support its great weight"],
        hint: "so ~ that 구문 (너무 ~해서 ...하다) + help (to) support"
      },
      {
        passageNo: "39번",
        korean: "그들은 사람들이 개에게 갖는 애정은 동물의 유전자보다는 함께 보낸 시간 때문이라고 지적한다.",
        targetSentence: "They point out that the love people have for their dogs is due more to the time spent with them than the genes",
        chips: ["They point out that", "the love people have for their dogs", "is due more to", "the time spent with them", "than the genes"],
        hint: "is due to (~ 때문이다) + 비교급(more A than B)"
      }
    ],
    summaryBlanks: [
      {
        passageNo: "38번",
        text: "Due to its immense size, the brontosaur relied on water for weight support and safety from land [ Blank A ].",
        optionsA: ["predators", "plants", "weather"],
        correctA: "predators"
      },
      {
        passageNo: "39번",
        text: "Critics of pet cloning argue that genuine affection stems from shared [ Blank A ] rather than genetic replication.",
        optionsA: ["experiences", "buying power", "physical traits"],
        correctA: "experiences"
      }
    ],
    originalPassages: [
      {
        no: "38번",
        text: "An animal as big as a house—a brontosaur—walked on Earth long before the first man did... It spent most of its time in the water. It was so big and heavy that it got tired quickly on land and needed the water to help support its great weight..."
      },
      {
        no: "39번",
        text: "Supporters of dog cloning stress how certain dogs are inherently skilled at rescue or guiding... In contrast, many opponents to cloning focus on its morality. They point out that the love people have for their dogs is due more to the time they spent with them than the animal's genes."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 7,
    title: "7회차 (40번)",
    passagesInfo: "40번: 지리학과 세계 정치 (요약문 핵심 유형)",
    vocabularies: [
      { id: 'v1', word: 'underpin', meaning: '뒷받침하다, 토대를 제공하다', passage: '40번' },
      { id: 'v2', word: 'disregarded', meaning: '무시된, 경시된', passage: '40번' },
      { id: 'v3', word: 'decisive', meaning: '결정적인', passage: '40번' },
      { id: 'v4', word: 'underestimated', meaning: '저평가된', passage: '40번' },
      { id: 'v5', word: 'overlooked', meaning: '간과된', passage: '40번' },
      { id: 'v6', word: 'barriers', meaning: '장벽, 장애물', passage: '40번' }
    ],
    unscrambles: [
      {
        passageNo: "40번-1",
        korean: "지리학은 사건의 원인과 본질 모두를 설명하는 데 중요한 역할을 한다.",
        targetSentence: "geography plays a crucial role in explaining both the causes and the nature of events",
        chips: ["geography plays a crucial role", "in explaining both", "the causes and", "the nature of events"],
        hint: "play a crucial role in -ing + both A and B"
      },
      {
        passageNo: "40번-2",
        korean: "비록 지리학이 자주 간과되지만, 세계 정치에 유의미한 영향을 미칠 수 있다.",
        targetSentence: "Though geography is often overlooked it can significantly influence global politics",
        chips: ["Though geography", "is often overlooked", "it can significantly influence", "global politics"],
        hint: "양보 접속사 Though + 수동태(is overlooked)"
      }
    ],
    summaryBlanks: [
      {
        passageNo: "40번",
        text: "Though geography is often [ Blank A ], it can significantly influence global politics by preventing or shaping potential conflicts.",
        optionsA: ["overlooked", "emphasized", "expanded"],
        correctA: "overlooked"
      }
    ],
    originalPassages: [
      {
        no: "40번",
        text: "The physical realities that underpin national and international politics are too often disregarded... Geography plays a crucial role in explaining both the causes and the nature of events. While geography may not always be the decisive factor, it is undoubtedly the most underestimated. Take China and India: separated by the Himalayas, large military advances are practically impossible, preventing major conflict."
      }
    ]
  }
];

const MOCK_STUDENTS = [
  { id: 1, name: "김철수", sessionCompleted: [1, 2, 3], currentSession: 4, vocabScore: 100, unscrambleScore: 90, summaryScore: 95, totalScore: 95, status: "completed" },
  { id: 2, name: "이영희", sessionCompleted: [1, 2], currentSession: 3, vocabScore: 85, unscrambleScore: 80, summaryScore: 90, totalScore: 85, status: "in_progress" },
  { id: 3, name: "박민수", sessionCompleted: [], currentSession: 1, vocabScore: 0, unscrambleScore: 0, summaryScore: 0, totalScore: 0, status: "not_started" },
  { id: 4, name: "최지훈", sessionCompleted: [1, 2, 3, 4], currentSession: 5, vocabScore: 95, unscrambleScore: 100, summaryScore: 90, totalScore: 95, status: "completed" },
  { id: 5, name: "정수빈", sessionCompleted: [1], currentSession: 2, vocabScore: 70, unscrambleScore: 75, summaryScore: 80, totalScore: 75, status: "in_progress" },
  { id: 6, name: "한지민", sessionCompleted: [1, 2, 3], currentSession: 4, vocabScore: 90, unscrambleScore: 85, summaryScore: 95, totalScore: 90, status: "completed" },
  { id: 7, name: "강동원", sessionCompleted: [], currentSession: 1, vocabScore: 0, unscrambleScore: 0, summaryScore: 0, totalScore: 0, status: "not_started" }
];

function App() {
  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = React.useState('student'); // 'student' or 'teacher'
  const [selectedSessionId, setSelectedSessionId] = React.useState(1);

  return (
    <div className="min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans">
      {/* Top Navbar */}
      <header className="bg-white/95 border-b border-indigo-200/80 px-4 py-3 sticky top-0 z-30 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/5 backdrop-blur-md">
        <div className="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-blue-600 via-indigo-600 to-violet-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-extrabold text-xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/30">
            <i className="fa-solid fa-bolt text-yellow-300"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h1 className="text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
              Reading Booster
              <span className="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold tracking-wide">Care</span>
            </h1>
            <p className="text-xs text-indigo-700 font-bold tracking-tight">English II_부교재 모의고사 10회 After-Reading Activity</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* View Switcher */}
        <div className="flex items-center bg-indigo-50/80 p-1 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/80">
          <button
            onClick={() => setActiveTab('student')}
            className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all flex items-center gap-2 ${
              activeTab === 'student'
                ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/20'
                : 'text-indigo-900 hover:text-indigo-600'
            }`}
          >
            <i className="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen-button"></i>
            학생용 앱 (10분 코스)
          </button>
          <button
            onClick={() => setActiveTab('teacher')}
            className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transition-all flex items-center gap-2 ${
              activeTab === 'teacher'
                ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/20'
                : 'text-indigo-900 hover:text-indigo-600'
            }`}
          >
            <i className="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i>
            교사 대시보드
          </button>
        </div>
      </header>

      {/* Main View Area */}
      <main className="flex-1 max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto p-3 sm:p-5">
        {activeTab === 'student' ? (
          <StudentAppView
            selectedSessionId={selectedSessionId}
            setSelectedSessionId={setSelectedSessionId}
          />
        ) : (
          <TeacherDashboardView />
        )}
      </main>

      {/* Footer */}
      <footer className="border-t border-indigo-100 bg-white/80 py-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">
        English II_부교재 모의고사 10회 After-Reading Activity • 1회차당 10분 고효율 마이크로 러닝
      </footer>
    </div>
  );
}

function StudentAppView({ selectedSessionId, setSelectedSessionId }) {
  const currentSession = SESSIONS_DATA.find(s => s.id === selectedSessionId) || SESSIONS_DATA[0];
  const [currentStep, setCurrentStep] = React.useState(1); // 1: Vocab, 2: Unscramble, 3: Summary, 4: Report
  const [isPassageModalOpen, setIsPassageModalOpen] = React.useState(false);
  
  // Timer State (10 Minutes Count Down)
  const [timeLeft, setTimeLeft] = React.useState(600); // 10 minutes = 600s
  const [isTimerRunning, setIsTimerRunning] = React.useState(true);

  // Quiz State
  const [userVocabScore, setUserVocabScore] = React.useState(0);
  const [userUnscrambleScore, setUserUnscrambleScore] = React.useState(0);
  const [userSummaryScore, setUserSummaryScore] = React.useState(0);

  // Reset module state when session changes
  React.useEffect(() => {
    setCurrentStep(1);
    setTimeLeft(600);
    setIsTimerRunning(true);
    setUserVocabScore(0);
    setUserUnscrambleScore(0);
    setUserSummaryScore(0);
  }, [selectedSessionId]);

  // Countdown timer effect
  React.useEffect(() => {
    if (!isTimerRunning || timeLeft <= 0) return;
    const timer = setInterval(() => {
      setTimeLeft(prev => prev - 1);
    }, 1000);
    return () => clearInterval(timer);
  }, [isTimerRunning, timeLeft]);

  const formatTime = (seconds) => {
    const m = Math.floor(seconds / 60);
    const s = seconds % 60;
    return `${m.toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${s.toString().padStart(2, '0')}`;
  };

  return (
    <div className="space-y-5">
      {/* Session Selection & Status Bar */}
      <div className="vivid-card rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-md shadow-indigo-500/5">
        <div className="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
          
          {/* Session Selector Dropdown / Pills */}
          <div className="flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto custom-scrollbar pb-1">
            {SESSIONS_DATA.map((sess) => (
              <button
                key={sess.id}
                onClick={() => setSelectedSessionId(sess.id)}
                className={`px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-black whitespace-nowrap transition-all border ${
                  selectedSessionId === sess.id
                    ? 'bg-indigo-600 border-indigo-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/30 scale-[1.02]'
                    : 'bg-white border-indigo-200 text-indigo-900 hover:bg-indigo-50 hover:border-indigo-300'
                }`}
              >
                {sess.id}회차
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>

          {/* Passage Peek Button & Timer */}
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between md:justify-end gap-3 border-t md:border-t-0 border-indigo-100 pt-3 md:pt-0">
            <button
              onClick={() => setIsPassageModalOpen(true)}
              className="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-600 hover:to-teal-700 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow-md shadow-emerald-500/20 flex items-center gap-2 transition-all active:scale-95"
            >
              <i className="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i>
              📄 원문 지문 보기
            </button>

            <div className="flex items-center gap-2 bg-indigo-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200">
              <i className="fa-solid fa-stopwatch text-indigo-600 text-sm animate-pulse"></i>
              <span className={`font-mono text-sm font-black ${timeLeft < 120 ? 'text-rose-600' : 'text-indigo-950'}`}>
                {formatTime(timeLeft)}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div className="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-indigo-100 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-xs">
          <span className="font-extrabold text-indigo-950"><i className="fa-solid fa-bookmark text-indigo-600 mr-1.5"></i>{currentSession.title}</span>
          <span className="text-indigo-700 font-semibold">{currentSession.passagesInfo}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Step Stepper Header */}
      <div className="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 bg-white/90 p-2 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200 shadow-sm">
        {[
          { step: 1, label: "1. 어휘 퀴즈", time: "2분", icon: "fa-bolt" },
          { step: 2, label: "2. 구문 영작", time: "4분", icon: "fa-cubes" },
          { step: 3, label: "3. 요약 완성", time: "3분", icon: "fa-pen-to-square" },
          { step: 4, label: "4. 리포트", time: "1분", icon: "fa-award" }
        ].map((item) => {
          const isActive = currentStep === item.step;
          const isDone = currentStep > item.step;
          return (
            <button
              key={item.step}
              onClick={() => setCurrentStep(item.step)}
              className={`p-2.5 rounded-xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center transition-all ${
                isActive
                  ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-blue-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25 font-black scale-[1.01]'
                  : isDone
                  ? 'bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-300 font-bold'
                  : 'bg-slate-50 text-slate-500 border border-slate-200 font-medium hover:bg-indigo-50'
              }`}
            >
              <i className={`fa-solid ${item.icon} text-sm mb-1`}></i>
              <span className="text-xs leading-tight">{item.label}</span>
              <span className="text-[10px] opacity-90 mt-0.5">{item.time}</span>
            </button>
          );
        })}
      </div>

      {/* Step Content Rendering */}
      <div className="vivid-card rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/5 min-h-[440px] flex flex-col justify-between">
        {currentStep === 1 && (
          <Step1VocabQuiz
            vocabularies={currentSession.vocabularies}
            onComplete={(score) => {
              setUserVocabScore(score);
              setCurrentStep(2);
              playSound('complete');
            }}
          />
        )}

        {currentStep === 2 && (
          <Step2Unscramble
            unscrambles={currentSession.unscrambles}
            onComplete={(score) => {
              setUserUnscrambleScore(score);
              setCurrentStep(3);
              playSound('complete');
            }}
          />
        )}

        {currentStep === 3 && (
          <Step3Summary
            summaries={currentSession.summaryBlanks}
            onComplete={(score) => {
              setUserSummaryScore(score);
              setIsTimerRunning(false);
              setCurrentStep(4);
              playSound('complete');
            }}
          />
        )}

        {currentStep === 4 && (
          <Step4Report
            session={currentSession}
            vocabScore={userVocabScore}
            unscrambleScore={userUnscrambleScore}
            summaryScore={userSummaryScore}
            timeSpent={600 - timeLeft}
            onRestart={() => {
              setCurrentStep(1);
              setTimeLeft(600);
              setIsTimerRunning(true);
            }}
            onNextSession={() => {
              if (selectedSessionId < SESSIONS_DATA.length) {
                setSelectedSessionId(prev => prev + 1);
              } else {
                setSelectedSessionId(1);
              }
            }}
          />
        )}
      </div>

      {/* Original Passage Peek Modal */}
      {isPassageModalOpen && (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
          <div className="bg-white border border-indigo-200 w-full max-w-3xl rounded-2xl max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl overflow-hidden animate-fadeIn">
            <div className="px-5 py-4 border-b border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-between bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-50 to-blue-50">
              <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
                <i className="fa-solid fa-file-lines text-indigo-600 text-lg"></i>
                <h3 className="font-extrabold text-indigo-950">{currentSession.title} 원문 지문 팝업</h3>
              </div>
              <button
                onClick={() => setIsPassageModalOpen(false)}
                className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 flex items-center justify-center transition-all shadow-sm"
              >
                <i className="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
              </button>
            </div>

            <div className="p-5 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              {currentSession.originalPassages.map((pas) => (
                <div key={pas.no} className="bg-indigo-50/40 rounded-xl p-4 border border-indigo-200/80">
                  <span className="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold rounded-lg text-xs mb-2 shadow-sm">
                    지문 {pas.no}
                  </span>
                  <p className="text-slate-900 font-serif leading-relaxed text-base font-medium">{pas.text}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>

            <div className="p-4 border-t border-indigo-100 bg-slate-50 text-right">
              <button
                onClick={() => setIsPassageModalOpen(false)}
                className="px-6 py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl transition-all shadow-md"
              >
                확인 완료 (지문 닫기)
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}

function Step1VocabQuiz({ vocabularies, onComplete }) {
  const [selectedWord, setSelectedWord] = React.useState(null);
  const [selectedMeaning, setSelectedMeaning] = React.useState(null);
  const [matchedPairs, setMatchedPairs] = React.useState([]);
  const [shuffledMeanings, setShuffledMeanings] = React.useState([]);
  const [attempts, setAttempts] = React.useState(0);

  React.useEffect(() => {
    // Shuffle meanings once on load
    const meanings = [...vocabularies].sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);
    setShuffledMeanings(meanings);
  }, [vocabularies]);

  const handleSelectWord = (vocab) => {
    if (matchedPairs.includes(vocab.id)) return;
    playSound('chip');
    setSelectedWord(vocab);
    if (selectedMeaning) {
      checkMatch(vocab, selectedMeaning);
    }
  };

  const handleSelectMeaning = (vocab) => {
    if (matchedPairs.includes(vocab.id)) return;
    playSound('chip');
    setSelectedMeaning(vocab);
    if (selectedWord) {
      checkMatch(selectedWord, vocab);
    }
  };

  const checkMatch = (wordObj, meaningObj) => {
    setAttempts(prev => prev + 1);
    if (wordObj.id === meaningObj.id) {
      playSound('correct');
      setMatchedPairs(prev => [...prev, wordObj.id]);
      setSelectedWord(null);
      setSelectedMeaning(null);
    } else {
      setTimeout(() => {
        setSelectedWord(null);
        setSelectedMeaning(null);
      }, 400);
    }
  };

  const isAllMatched = matchedPairs.length === vocabularies.length;

  return (
    <div className="space-y-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 className="text-base font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span className="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black shadow-sm">1</span>
            어휘 스피드 매칭 (Matching Quiz)
          </h2>
          <span className="text-xs text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-300 font-extrabold">
            진행도: {matchedPairs.length} / {vocabularies.length}
          </span>
        </div>
        <p className="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium mb-4">영단어 카드와 이에 해당하는 한글 뜻 카드를 터치하여 매칭하세요.</p>

        {/* Matching Grid */}
        <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {/* English Words Column */}
          <div className="space-y-2">
            <h3 className="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">영단어 (English Words)</h3>
            {vocabularies.map((item) => {
              const isMatched = matchedPairs.includes(item.id);
              const isSelected = selectedWord?.id === item.id;
              return (
                <button
                  key={item.id}
                  disabled={isMatched}
                  onClick={() => handleSelectWord(item)}
                  className={`w-full p-3.5 rounded-xl border text-left font-bold text-sm transition-all flex items-center justify-between ${
                    isMatched
                      ? 'bg-emerald-100/80 border-emerald-300 text-emerald-900 opacity-70'
                      : isSelected
                      ? 'bg-indigo-600 border-indigo-600 text-white shadow-lg chip-glow scale-[1.01]'
                      : 'bg-white border-indigo-200/90 text-slate-900 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-indigo-50/50 shadow-sm'
                  }`}
                >
                  <span>{item.word}</span>
                  <span className="text-[10px] text-indigo-800 bg-indigo-50 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-indigo-200">{item.passage}</span>
                </button>
              );
            })}
          </div>

          {/* Korean Meanings Column */}
          <div className="space-y-2">
            <h3 className="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">한글 뜻 (Korean Meanings)</h3>
            {shuffledMeanings.map((item) => {
              const isMatched = matchedPairs.includes(item.id);
              const isSelected = selectedMeaning?.id === item.id;
              return (
                <button
                  key={item.id}
                  disabled={isMatched}
                  onClick={() => handleSelectMeaning(item)}
                  className={`w-full p-3.5 rounded-xl border text-left font-bold text-sm transition-all flex items-center justify-between ${
                    isMatched
                      ? 'bg-emerald-100/80 border-emerald-300 text-emerald-900 opacity-70'
                      : isSelected
                      ? 'bg-indigo-600 border-indigo-600 text-white shadow-lg chip-glow scale-[1.01]'
                      : 'bg-white border-indigo-200/90 text-slate-900 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:bg-indigo-50/50 shadow-sm'
                  }`}
                >
                  <span>{item.meaning}</span>
                  {isMatched && <i className="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600 text-xs"></i>}
                </button>
              );
            })}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Completion Actions */}
      <div className="pt-4 border-t border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-end">
        <button
          disabled={!isAllMatched}
          onClick={() => {
            const score = Math.max(60, 100 - (attempts - vocabularies.length) * 5);
            onComplete(score);
          }}
          className={`px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition-all ${
            isAllMatched
              ? 'bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 text-white shadow-md'
              : 'bg-slate-200 text-slate-400 cursor-not-allowed'
          }`}
        >
          <span>2단계 구문 영작으로 이동</span>
          <i className="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

function Step2Unscramble({ unscrambles, onComplete }) {
  const [currentIndex, setCurrentIndex] = React.useState(0);
  const currentItem = unscrambles[currentIndex];

  const [availableChips, setAvailableChips] = React.useState([]);
  const [placedChips, setPlacedChips] = React.useState([]);
  const [showHint, setShowHint] = React.useState(false);
  const [isCorrect, setIsCorrect] = React.useState(false);
  const [scores, setScores] = React.useState([]);

  // Load chips when current question changes
  React.useEffect(() => {
    if (currentItem) {
      const shuffled = [...currentItem.chips].sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5);
      setAvailableChips(shuffled);
      setPlacedChips([]);
      setIsCorrect(false);
      setShowHint(false);
    }
  }, [currentIndex, currentItem]);

  const handleAddChip = (chip) => {
    playSound('chip');
    setAvailableChips(prev => prev.filter(c => c !== chip));
    setPlacedChips(prev => [...prev, chip]);
  };

  const handleRemoveChip = (chip) => {
    playSound('chip');
    setPlacedChips(prev => prev.filter(c => c !== chip));
    setAvailableChips(prev => [...prev, chip]);
  };

  const handleCheckAnswer = () => {
    const userSentence = placedChips.join(" ");
    if (userSentence === currentItem.targetSentence) {
      playSound('correct');
      setIsCorrect(true);
      setScores(prev => [...prev, showHint ? 85 : 100]);
    } else {
      playSound('chip');
      alert("순서가 일치하지 않습니다. 조각 위치를 수정해보세요!");
    }
  };

  const handleNextSentence = () => {
    if (currentIndex < unscrambles.length - 1) {
      setCurrentIndex(prev => prev + 1);
    } else {
      const totalScore = Math.round(scores.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / unscrambles.length);
      onComplete(totalScore || 90);
    }
  };

  return (
    <div className="space-y-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 className="text-base font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span className="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black shadow-sm">2</span>
            킬러 구문 Unscrambling ({currentIndex + 1} / {unscrambles.length})
          </h2>
          <span className="text-xs font-extrabold text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-300">
            {currentItem.passageNo}
          </span>
        </div>

        {/* Korean Meaning Prompt */}
        <div className="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-50 via-blue-50 to-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200/90 mb-4 shadow-sm">
          <p className="text-xs text-indigo-800 mb-1 font-bold">해석 (Korean Meaning)</p>
          <p className="text-sm font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">{currentItem.korean}</p>
        </div>

        {/* Sentence Placement Zone */}
        <div className="mb-4">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-2">
            <span>완성할 영어 문장 영역</span>
            <button
              onClick={() => setShowHint(!showHint)}
              className="text-amber-600 hover:text-amber-700 font-extrabold flex items-center gap-1 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-amber-200"
            >
              <i className="fa-solid fa-lightbulb"></i>
              {showHint ? "구문 힌트 닫기" : "💡 구문 힌트 보기"}
            </button>
          </div>

          {showHint && (
            <div className="mb-3 p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-300 rounded-xl text-xs text-amber-950 font-semibold animate-fadeIn">
              <strong>힌트 구조:</strong> {currentItem.hint}
            </div>
          )}

          <div className="min-h-[105px] p-4 bg-indigo-50/30 border-2 border-dashed border-indigo-300 rounded-xl flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center align-content-start">
            {placedChips.length === 0 ? (
              <span className="text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold italic">아래 단어 블록을 터치하여 이곳에 배치하세요.</span>
            ) : (
              placedChips.map((chip, idx) => (
                <button
                  key={idx}
                  onClick={() => handleRemoveChip(chip)}
                  className="px-3.5 py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-all active:scale-95"
                >
                  <span>{chip}</span>
                  <i className="fa-solid fa-xmark text-[10px] opacity-80"></i>
                </button>
              ))
            )}
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Available Chips Pool */}
        <div>
          <p className="text-xs text-slate-700 mb-2 font-bold">단어/구 블록 목록</p>
          <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {availableChips.map((chip, idx) => (
              <button
                key={idx}
                onClick={() => handleAddChip(chip)}
                className="px-3.5 py-2.5 bg-white hover:bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 text-indigo-950 font-bold text-xs rounded-xl transition-all active:scale-95 shadow-sm"
              >
                {chip}
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Actions */}
      <div className="pt-4 border-t border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-between">
        <button
          onClick={() => {
            const allChips = [...placedChips, ...availableChips];
            setAvailableChips(allChips.sort(() => Math.random() - 0.5));
            setPlacedChips([]);
            setIsCorrect(false);
          }}
          className="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all border border-slate-300"
        >
          초기화
        </button>

        {!isCorrect ? (
          <button
            disabled={placedChips.length === 0}
            onClick={handleCheckAnswer}
            className={`px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition-all ${
              placedChips.length > 0
                ? 'bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-white shadow-md'
                : 'bg-slate-200 text-slate-400 cursor-not-allowed'
            }`}
          >
            <i className="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
            정답 확인하기
          </button>
        ) : (
          <button
            onClick={handleNextSentence}
            className="px-6 py-2.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md transition-all"
          >
            <span>{currentIndex < unscrambles.length - 1 ? "다음 문장 도전" : "3단계 요약 완성으로 이동"}</span>
            <i className="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
          </button>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

function Step3Summary({ summaries, onComplete }) {
  const [selectedAnswers, setSelectedAnswers] = React.useState({});
  const [submitted, setSubmitted] = React.useState(false);

  const handleSelect = (idx, val) => {
    playSound('chip');
    setSelectedAnswers(prev => ({ ...prev, [idx]: val }));
  };

  const handleSubmit = () => {
    let correctCount = 0;
    summaries.forEach((s, idx) => {
      if (selectedAnswers[idx] === s.correctA) correctCount++;
    });
    playSound('correct');
    setSubmitted(true);
  };

  const allSelected = Object.keys(selectedAnswers).length === summaries.length;

  return (
    <div className="space-y-5 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 className="text-base font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span className="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black shadow-sm">3</span>
            수능형 핵심 요약문 빈칸 완성
          </h2>
          <span className="text-xs text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-indigo-300 font-extrabold">
            총 {summaries.length} 문항
          </span>
        </div>
        <p className="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium mb-4">각 지문의 주제를 관통하는 핵심 요약문의 빈칸 [ Blank A ]에 들어갈 단어를 고르세요.</p>

        <div className="space-y-4">
          {summaries.map((item, idx) => (
            <div key={idx} className="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3">
              <div className="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span className="text-xs font-extrabold text-indigo-900 bg-indigo-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-indigo-200">
                  지문 {item.passageNo}
                </span>
                {submitted && (
                  <span className={`text-xs font-black ${selectedAnswers[idx] === item.correctA ? 'text-emerald-600' : 'text-rose-600'}`}>
                    {selectedAnswers[idx] === item.correctA ? '✓ 정답' : `✕ 오답 (정답: ${item.correctA})`}
                  </span>
                )}
              </div>

              <p className="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
                {item.text.replace('[ Blank A ]', '_______')}
              </p>

              <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
                {item.optionsA.map((opt) => {
                  const isSelected = selectedAnswers[idx] === opt;
                  return (
                    <button
                      key={opt}
                      disabled={submitted}
                      onClick={() => handleSelect(idx, opt)}
                      className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold border transition-all ${
                        isSelected
                          ? 'bg-indigo-600 border-indigo-600 text-white shadow-md'
                          : 'bg-indigo-50/50 border-indigo-200 text-indigo-950 hover:bg-indigo-100/60'
                      }`}
                    >
                      {opt}
                    </button>
                  );
                })}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div className="pt-4 border-t border-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-end">
        {!submitted ? (
          <button
            disabled={!allSelected}
            onClick={handleSubmit}
            className={`px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition-all ${
              allSelected
                ? 'bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white shadow-md'
                : 'bg-slate-200 text-slate-400 cursor-not-allowed'
            }`}
          >
            <span>요약 제출 및 결과 확인</span>
            <i className="fa-solid fa-check"></i>
          </button>
        ) : (
          <button
            onClick={() => {
              let correct = 0;
              summaries.forEach((s, idx) => {
                if (selectedAnswers[idx] === s.correctA) correct++;
              });
              const score = Math.round((correct / summaries.length) * 100);
              onComplete(score);
            }}
            className="px-6 py-3 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl flex items-center gap-2 shadow-md transition-all"
          >
            <span>최종 리포트 카드 보기</span>
            <i className="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
          </button>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

function Step4Report({ session, vocabScore, unscrambleScore, summaryScore, timeSpent, onRestart, onNextSession }) {
  const overallScore = Math.round((vocabScore + unscrambleScore + summaryScore) / 3);

  return (
    <div className="space-y-6 text-center py-4 animate-fadeIn">
      {/* Badge Header */}
      <div className="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-400 via-indigo-600 to-blue-600 text-white text-3xl shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/30 mb-2">
        <i className="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span className="px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-900 border border-indigo-300 rounded-full text-xs font-black">
          {session.title} 완주 성공!
        </span>
        <h2 className="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mt-2">10분 After-Reading 리포트</h2>
        <p className="text-xs text-slate-600 font-semibold mt-1">소요 시간: {Math.floor(timeSpent / 60)}분 {timeSpent % 60}초</p>
      </div>

      {/* Main Score Box */}
      <div className="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 max-w-md mx-auto shadow-md">
        <p className="text-xs text-slate-600 font-bold mb-1">오늘의 독해 완성도</p>
        <div className="text-4xl font-black text-indigo-600 mb-4">{overallScore}점</div>

        {/* Breakdown Progress Bars */}
        <div className="space-y-3 text-left">
          <div>
            <div className="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">
              <span>1단계 어휘 스피드</span>
              <span>{vocabScore}점</span>
            </div>
            <div className="w-full h-3 bg-indigo-50 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-indigo-100">
              <div className="h-full bg-indigo-600 transition-all duration-1000" style={{ width: `${vocabScore}%` }}></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div className="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">
              <span>2단계 구문 Unscrambling</span>
              <span>{unscrambleScore}점</span>
            </div>
            <div className="w-full h-3 bg-indigo-50 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-indigo-100">
              <div className="h-full bg-violet-600 transition-all duration-1000" style={{ width: `${unscrambleScore}%` }}></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div className="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 mb-1">
              <span>3단계 요약문 빈칸</span>
              <span>{summaryScore}점</span>
            </div>
            <div className="w-full h-3 bg-indigo-50 rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-indigo-100">
              <div className="h-full bg-emerald-600 transition-all duration-1000" style={{ width: `${summaryScore}%` }}></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Achievement Note */}
      <div className="bg-emerald-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-emerald-300 text-xs text-emerald-950 max-w-md mx-auto text-left flex items-start gap-3 shadow-sm">
        <i className="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600 text-base mt-0.5"></i>
        <div>
          <p className="font-extrabold text-emerald-950">나만의 오답 노트 자동 저장 완료</p>
          <p className="text-emerald-800 mt-0.5 font-medium">오늘 틀린 구문과 어휘는 시험 대비 복습장에 수록되었습니다. 교사 대시보드에 학습 현황이 전송되었습니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Action Buttons */}
      <div className="pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <button
          onClick={onRestart}
          className="px-5 py-2.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 font-bold text-xs rounded-xl border border-slate-300 transition-all"
        >
          다시 풀기
        </button>
        <button
          onClick={onNextSession}
          className="px-6 py-2.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 hover:from-blue-700 hover:to-indigo-700 text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all"
        >
          다음 회차 도전하기
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

function TeacherDashboardView() {
  const [students, setStudents] = React.useState(MOCK_STUDENTS);
  const [selectedSessionFilter, setSelectedSessionFilter] = React.useState('all');
  const [selectedStudent, setSelectedStudent] = React.useState(null);
  const [toastMessage, setToastMessage] = React.useState('');

  const showToast = (msg) => {
    setToastMessage(msg);
    setTimeout(() => setToastMessage(''), 3000);
  };

  // Metrics
  const totalStudents = students.length;
  const completedCount = students.filter(s => s.status === 'completed').length;
  const inProgressCount = students.filter(s => s.status === 'in_progress').length;
  const notStartedCount = students.filter(s => s.status === 'not_started').length;
  const avgClassScore = Math.round(
    students.filter(s => s.totalScore > 0).reduce((a, b) => a + b.totalScore, 0) /
    (students.filter(s => s.totalScore > 0).length || 1)
  );

  return (
    <div className="space-y-6">
      {/* Toast Notification */}
      {toastMessage && (
        <div className="fixed top-20 right-5 z-50 bg-emerald-600 text-white px-4 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-xl font-bold text-xs flex items-center gap-2 animate-bounce">
          <i className="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
          {toastMessage}
        </div>
      )}

      {/* Dashboard Top Stats Banner */}
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold">
            <span>전체 학생 수</span>
            <i className="fa-solid fa-users text-indigo-600"></i>
          </div>
          <div className="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 mt-2">{totalStudents}명</div>
          <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1 font-semibold">English II 수강생 전체</p>
        </div>

        <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold">
            <span>완료 및 진행률</span>
            <i className="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-emerald-600"></i>
          </div>
          <div className="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-600 mt-2">
            {Math.round(((completedCount + inProgressCount) / totalStudents) * 100)}%
          </div>
          <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1 font-semibold">완료: {completedCount}명 | 진행중: {inProgressCount}명</p>
        </div>

        <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold">
            <span>반 평균 성취도</span>
            <i className="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-amber-500"></i>
          </div>
          <div className="text-2xl font-black text-amber-600 mt-2">{avgClassScore}점</div>
          <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1 font-semibold">어휘 90점 | 구문 82점 | 요약 88점</p>
        </div>

        <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <div className="flex items-center justify-between text-slate-700 text-xs font-bold">
            <span>미참여 학생 케어</span>
            <i className="fa-solid fa-bell text-rose-500"></i>
          </div>
          <div className="text-2xl font-black text-rose-600 mt-2">{notStartedCount}명</div>
          <button
            onClick={() => showToast("미참여 학생 2명에게 독촉 알림 메시지를 전송하였습니다.")}
            className="mt-2 w-full py-1.5 bg-rose-50 hover:bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 font-bold text-[11px] rounded-lg border border-rose-300 transition-all"
          >
            ⚠️ 전체 독촉 알림 보내기
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Main Table Section */}
      <div className="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        <div className="p-4 sm:p-5 border-b border-indigo-100 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-50/50 to-white">
          <div>
            <h2 className="text-base font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
              <i className="fa-solid fa-list-check text-indigo-600"></i>
              실시간 학생별 10분 코스 수행 현황
            </h2>
            <p className="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium">학생들의 각 단계별 점수와 완료 여부를 모니터링합니다.</p>
          </div>

          <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">상태 필터:</span>
            <select
              value={selectedSessionFilter}
              onChange={(e) => setSelectedSessionFilter(e.target.value)}
              className="bg-indigo-50/60 border border-indigo-200 text-xs text-indigo-950 font-bold rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 focus:outline-none"
            >
              <option value="all">전체 상태 보기</option>
              <option value="completed">완료된 학생만</option>
              <option value="in_progress">진행 중인 학생만</option>
              <option value="not_started">미참여 학생만</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Table */}
        <div className="overflow-x-auto custom-scrollbar">
          <table className="w-full text-left text-xs">
            <thead className="bg-indigo-50/70 text-indigo-950 uppercase font-bold border-b border-indigo-200">
              <tr>
                <th className="p-3.5">학생 이름</th>
                <th className="p-3.5">참여 상태</th>
                <th className="p-3.5">현재 진행 회차</th>
                <th className="p-3.5">1단계 어휘</th>
                <th className="p-3.5">2단계 구문 영작</th>
                <th className="p-3.5">3단계 요약문</th>
                <th className="p-3.5">최종 점수</th>
                <th className="p-3.5 text-right">관리 Action</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody className="divide-y divide-indigo-100 font-semibold">
              {students
                .filter(s => selectedSessionFilter === 'all' || s.status === selectedSessionFilter)
                .map((student) => (
                  <tr key={student.id} className="hover:bg-indigo-50/40 transition-colors">
                    <td className="p-3.5 font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
                      <div className="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 border border-indigo-300 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-800 text-[11px] font-bold">
                        {student.name[0]}
                      </div>
                      {student.name}
                    </td>

                    <td className="p-3.5">
                      {student.status === 'completed' && (
                        <span className="px-2.5 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-300 rounded-full font-bold">
                          ● 학습 완료
                        </span>
                      )}
                      {student.status === 'in_progress' && (
                        <span className="px-2.5 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-300 rounded-full font-bold animate-pulse">
                          ▲ 풀이 진행중
                        </span>
                      )}
                      {student.status === 'not_started' && (
                        <span className="px-2.5 py-1 bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 border border-rose-300 rounded-full font-bold">
                          ✕ 미참여
                        </span>
                      )}
                    </td>

                    <td className="p-3.5 text-slate-800">{student.currentSession}회차</td>
                    <td className="p-3.5 text-slate-800">{student.vocabScore > 0 ? `${student.vocabScore}점` : '-'}</td>
                    <td className="p-3.5 text-slate-800">{student.unscrambleScore > 0 ? `${student.unscrambleScore}점` : '-'}</td>
                    <td className="p-3.5 text-slate-800">{student.summaryScore > 0 ? `${student.summaryScore}점` : '-'}</td>
                    <td className="p-3.5 font-black text-indigo-600">
                      {student.totalScore > 0 ? `${student.totalScore}점` : '-'}
                    </td>

                    <td className="p-3.5 text-right space-x-2">
                      <button
                        onClick={() => setSelectedStudent(student)}
                        className="px-2.5 py-1 bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-900 rounded-lg text-[11px] font-bold border border-indigo-200"
                      >
                        상세 분석
                      </button>
                      {student.status === 'not_started' && (
                        <button
                          onClick={() => showToast(`${student.name} 학생에게 독촉 메시지를 전송했습니다.`)}
                          className="px-2.5 py-1 bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white rounded-lg text-[11px] font-bold shadow-sm"
                        >
                          알림
                        </button>
                      )}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Class Weakness & Analytics Section */}
      <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <h3 className="text-sm font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i className="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-amber-500"></i>
            반 전체 최고 오답률 영작 문장 Top 2
          </h3>
          <div className="space-y-3">
            <div className="bg-indigo-50/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200">
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-rose-600 mb-1">
                <span>34번 지문 McGurk Effect</span>
                <span>오답률 52%</span>
              </div>
              <p className="text-xs text-slate-900 font-serif font-medium">"...demonstrates that visual information directly modifies our auditory experience."</p>
              <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1 font-semibold">주요 오답 사유: 접속사 that 이하의 목적어 명사절 순서 혼동</p>
            </div>

            <div className="bg-indigo-50/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200">
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-amber-600 mb-1">
                <span>29번 지문 Companion Pets</span>
                <span>오답률 41%</span>
              </div>
              <p className="text-xs text-slate-900 font-serif font-medium">"...could not have given up an addiction without the pet..."</p>
              <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-600 mt-1 font-semibold">주요 오답 사유: 가정법 과거완료 (could not have p.p.) 구문 배치 오류</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200/90 shadow-sm">
          <h3 className="text-sm font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i className="fa-solid fa-spell-check text-indigo-600"></i>
            반 전체 고난도 어휘 집중 복습 대상
          </h3>
          <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
            {[
              { word: "fortification", mean: "강화, 보강", errorRate: "65%" },
              { word: "cliffhanger", mean: "위기 상황", errorRate: "58%" },
              { word: "underpin", mean: "뒷받침하다", errorRate: "49%" },
              { word: "alienate", mean: "소외시키다", errorRate: "44%" }
            ].map((v, i) => (
              <div key={i} className="bg-indigo-50/40 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 flex justify-between items-center">
                <div>
                  <div className="font-bold text-indigo-800">{v.word}</div>
                  <div className="text-[11px] text-slate-600">{v.mean}</div>
                </div>
                <span className="text-[11px] font-bold text-rose-600 bg-rose-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-rose-200">
                  {v.errorRate}
                </span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Student Detail Modal */}
      {selectedStudent && (
        <div className="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4">
          <div className="bg-white border border-indigo-200 w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl relative animate-fadeIn">
            <button
              onClick={() => setSelectedStudent(null)}
              className="absolute top-4 right-4 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center"
            >
              <i className="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
            </button>

            <h3 className="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
              <i className="fa-solid fa-user-graduate text-indigo-600"></i>
              {selectedStudent.name} 학생 상세 성취도
            </h3>
            <p className="text-xs text-slate-600 font-semibold mt-0.5">English II • 현재 진행: {selectedStudent.currentSession}회차</p>

            <div className="my-5 space-y-3 bg-indigo-50/40 p-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 text-xs">
              <div className="flex justify-between border-b border-indigo-200/80 pb-2">
                <span className="text-slate-700 font-medium">1단계 어휘 점수:</span>
                <span className="font-black text-indigo-600">{selectedStudent.vocabScore}점</span>
              </div>
              <div className="flex justify-between border-b border-indigo-200/80 pb-2">
                <span className="text-slate-700 font-medium">2단계 영작 Unscramble 점수:</span>
                <span className="font-black text-violet-600">{selectedStudent.unscrambleScore}점</span>
              </div>
              <div className="flex justify-between border-b border-indigo-200/80 pb-2">
                <span className="text-slate-700 font-medium">3단계 요약문 점수:</span>
                <span className="font-black text-emerald-600">{selectedStudent.summaryScore}점</span>
              </div>
              <div className="flex justify-between pt-1">
                <span className="font-black text-slate-900">총 종합 평점:</span>
                <span className="font-black text-amber-600 text-sm">{selectedStudent.totalScore}점</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="flex justify-end gap-2">
              <button
                onClick={() => {
                  showToast(`${selectedStudent.name} 학생 오답 리포트 출력이 완료되었습니다.`);
                  setSelectedStudent(null);
                }}
                className="w-full py-2.5 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all"
              >
                개인별 오답 리포트 PDF 다운로드
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  );
}

window.onload = function() {
  const rootElement = document.getElementById('root');
  if (rootElement) {
    ReactDOM.createRoot(rootElement).render(<App />);
  }
};
</script>
</body>
</html>
